      "name": "9.1_architecture_overview.md",
      "filePath": "09_gateway_protocol/9.1_architecture_overview.md",
      "summary": "Presents the five-plane architectural framework (Control, Data, Context, Trust, and Visibility planes) for understanding Gateway responsibilities and module boundaries. Analyzes plane interactions, execution surface separation, and cross-plane diagnostic tracing.",
