      "type": "document",
      "name": "9.2_control_plane.md",
      "filePath": "09_gateway_protocol/9.2_control_plane.md",
      "summary": "Explores the five core duties and boundaries of the Gateway Control Plane: connection attribution, routing, session lifecycle, policy enforcement, and circuit-breaking failover. Introduces layered approval architecture and practical openclaw.json configuration examples.",
